{
  "_comment": [
    "MRLN deploy map — the single source of truth for what gh-pages serves.",
    "SOURCE FILENAME != PUBLISHED FILENAME. Source keeps index.html for the app so that",
    "green.js (APP_VER) and preflight.js (security profile by basename) keep working",
    "untouched through the root migration; the rename happens ONLY here, at deploy time.",
    "role: app | marketing | static | stub — preflight.js selects its profile from this,",
    "and fails CLOSED to the full app profile when a file is not declared."
  ],
  "phase": 0,
  "_phase_note": [
    "0 = current live layout, app at the root. 1 = app also published at app.html.",
    "2 = sw.js/manifest repointed at app.html (root is STILL the app). 3 = the swap.",
    "tools/test/routing_test.js ARMS additional assertions as this number rises, and",
    "prints which ones are armed — so a phase can never advance without its own guards."
  ],
